{"seq":3,"slug":"narrative-structure-for-data","title":"数据的叙事结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-storytelling-communication/foundations/narrative-structure-for-data","wordCount":1367,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据的叙事结构\">数据的叙事结构</h1><p>分析做完时，你手上是一堆零散发现：这个指标涨了、那个分群异常、某个相关性挺强。直接按这个顺序讲，听众会迷路。叙事结构的作用，是给这堆发现一副骨架，让它们从「一袋零件」变成「一台有起承转合的机器」。本篇讲几套可复用的结构骨架——它是抽象的脚手架，到 <a href=\"../communication/building-narrative-arc\">构建叙事弧线</a> 会被填成一份具体可讲的演示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据叙事最常用的三套结构其实同源：都遵循「设定背景 → 制造张力 → 给出解决」的三幕式。区别在于侧重——背景-冲突-解决偏剧情张力，金字塔原理偏逻辑严密，SCQA 介于两者之间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[一堆零散发现] --&gt; B[选一套结构骨架]&#10;    B --&gt; C[背景-冲突-解决&lt;br/&gt;偏张力]&#10;    B --&gt; D[金字塔原理&lt;br/&gt;偏逻辑]&#10;    B --&gt; E[SCQA&lt;br/&gt;情境-冲突-问题-答案]&#10;    C --&gt; F[设定: 现状基线]&#10;    F --&gt; G[冲突: 反差-异常-风险]&#10;    G --&gt; H[洞见: 数据揭示的因]&#10;    H --&gt; I[解决: 行动号召]&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    I --&gt; J[一条有指向的叙事线]\">graph TD\n    A[一堆零散发现] --&gt; B[选一套结构骨架]\n    B --&gt; C[背景-冲突-解决&lt;br/&gt;偏张力]\n    B --&gt; D[金字塔原理&lt;br/&gt;偏逻辑]\n    B --&gt; E[SCQA&lt;br/&gt;情境-冲突-问题-答案]\n    C --&gt; F[设定: 现状基线]\n    F --&gt; G[冲突: 反差-异常-风险]\n    G --&gt; H[洞见: 数据揭示的因]\n    H --&gt; I[解决: 行动号召]\n    D --&gt; H\n    E --&gt; G\n    I --&gt; J[一条有指向的叙事线]</pre><p>下表对比三套结构的适用场景，帮你按汇报类型选骨架。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>一句话形态</th>\n<th>最适合</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>背景-冲突-解决</td>\n<td>「本来…直到…于是…」</td>\n<td>有明确转折/异常的故事</td>\n<td>硬造冲突显得做作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金字塔原理</td>\n<td>「结论，因为 A、B、C」</td>\n<td>需说服、逻辑要严的汇报</td>\n<td>缺张力、偏枯燥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SCQA</td>\n<td>「情境-冲突-问题-答案」</td>\n<td>咨询式问题界定</td>\n<td>四段易写成八股</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"背景-冲突-解决-给数据制造张力\">背景-冲突-解决：给数据制造张力</h2><p>人脑对「张力—释放」的节奏天然敏感。背景-冲突-解决（也叫 setup-conflict-resolution）把这套节奏搬进数据汇报：<strong>背景</strong>确立一个让所有人都点头的现状基线（「我们一直靠 A 渠道获客，CAC 稳定在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext>」），</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mtext>冲突</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mtext>抛出打破平静的反差或异常（「但这个季度</mtext><mi>A</mi><mtext>渠道</mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mtext>涨到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40」），**冲突**抛出打破平静的反差或异常（「但这个季度 A 渠道 CAC 涨到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">」），</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">冲突</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">抛出打破平静的反差或异常（「但这个季度</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">渠道</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">涨到</span></span></span></span></span>92，而我们没察觉」），<strong>解决</strong>给出由数据支撑的出路（「把预算切向 B 渠道，预计把整体 CAC 拉回 $55」）。</p>\n<p>关键在于冲突必须是真实的、来自数据的张力，而不是为了戏剧性硬造。真冲突往往就是你分析里最反直觉的那个发现——它之所以值得汇报，正因为它打破了某种预期。找不到冲突，常意味着这份分析其实没有值得讲的洞见。</p>\n<h2 id=\"金字塔原理-逻辑优先的骨架\">金字塔原理：逻辑优先的骨架</h2><p>当受众挑剔、需要被逻辑说服时，巴巴拉·明托的金字塔原理更稳：塔尖是单一核心结论，下面是支撑它的几个论点，每个论点再由数据支撑。它的硬规矩是同一层的论点要 MECE——相互独立、完全穷尽，不重叠也不漏。</p>\n<p>金字塔的好处是抗打断：先抛结论，听众随时离场都已拿到要点；想深究的人再往下看支撑。它与 <a href=\"audience-context-framing\">受众与情境框定</a> 里的倒金字塔信息层级是同一思想的两种表述。代价是缺乏戏剧张力，适合评审而非动员。两者并不互斥——可以用金字塔保证逻辑骨架，再在塔尖结论的呈现上借一点背景-冲突-解决的张力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把发现映射到结构-一张工作表\">把发现映射到结构：一张工作表</h2><p>落地时，建议先做一次「发现 → 角色」的映射，判断每个发现在故事里演什么。可以用一个简单的优先级打分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i = w_r \\cdot r_i + w_s \\cdot s_i - w_c \\cdot c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该发现与受众决策的相关度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是意外程度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是讲清它所需的认知成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是权重。得分最高的当核心结论或冲突，低分的降级为附录或直接砍掉。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发现</th>\n<th>在故事里的角色</th>\n<th>配什么视觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>现状基线指标</td>\n<td>背景</td>\n<td>一条平稳的趋势线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最反直觉的异常</td>\n<td>冲突</td>\n<td>高亮的跳变点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常的根因</td>\n<td>洞见</td>\n<td>分群对比/拆解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建议的动作</td>\n<td>解决</td>\n<td>预期效果对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次要相关性</td>\n<td>附录或砍掉</td>\n<td>（多半不画）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表强迫你对每个发现问「它在故事里干什么」，没有角色的发现就该被删——这正是叙事作为有损压缩的体现（见 <a href=\"why-data-storytelling\">为何需要数据叙事</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构不是模板-是检验\">结构不是模板，是检验</h2><p>新手常把结构当填空模板，硬把分析塞进背景-冲突-解决三个格子，结果生造冲突、堆砌过渡词。更好的用法是把结构当<strong>检验清单</strong>：我的故事有没有一个所有人认同的起点？有没有一个真实的、来自数据的张力？这个张力有没有被数据支撑的解决？有没有落到一个具体行动？四个都有，故事自然成立；缺哪个，说明分析或表达还差一截，而不是再加一句过渡词能补的。当你把骨架填成具体一页页的演示时，转入 <a href=\"../communication/building-narrative-arc\">构建叙事弧线</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三套主流结构同源于三幕式：背景-冲突-解决偏张力，金字塔偏逻辑，SCQA 居中。</li>\n<li>背景-冲突-解决的冲突必须来自数据的真实张力，硬造即露馅。</li>\n<li>金字塔原理要求同层论点 MECE，抗打断、适合说服型评审。</li>\n<li>用「发现→角色」映射 + 优先级打分，给每个发现派角色，无角色者删。</li>\n<li>把结构当检验清单而非填空模板：起点、张力、解决、行动四问皆通才算成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>上游：先框定给谁讲：<a href=\"audience-context-framing\">受众与情境框定</a></li>\n<li>下游：把骨架填成可讲的弧线：<a href=\"../communication/building-narrative-arc\">构建叙事弧线</a></li>\n<li>跨库——叙事里图表如何讲故事：<a href=\"../../data-visualization/dashboard-design/data-storytelling\">数据可视化·数据叙事</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据的叙事结构","id":"数据的叙事结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"背景-冲突-解决：给数据制造张力","id":"背景-冲突-解决-给数据制造张力"},{"level":2,"text":"金字塔原理：逻辑优先的骨架","id":"金字塔原理-逻辑优先的骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"把发现映射到结构：一张工作表","id":"把发现映射到结构-一张工作表"},{"level":2,"text":"结构不是模板，是检验","id":"结构不是模板-是检验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"受众与情境框定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-storytelling-communication/foundations/audience-context-framing"},"next":{"title":"图表选择与视觉编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-storytelling-communication/visualization-craft/chart-selection-encoding"}}